<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.309" end="00:00:03.329" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.600" end="00:00:17.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at my table.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.400" end="00:00:19.700" style="s2">In this house, maids eat on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.400" end="00:00:19.700" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.900" end="00:00:27.500" style="s2">Ife, my fiance sits by me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.500" end="00:00:29.500" style="s2">You sit down there.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.500" end="00:00:31.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, I can eat in the kitchen after your</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.500" end="00:00:34.099" style="s2">guests have finished. I will not disturb</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.500" end="00:00:34.099" style="s2">anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.900" end="00:00:39.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will disturb nobody on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.100" end="00:00:41.975" style="s2">That is what the floor is for.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.955" end="00:00:41.975" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.575" end="00:00:44.595" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.900" end="00:00:50.700" style="s2">Babe, at least give the girl a spoon.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.500" end="00:00:53.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her fingers are her spoon. They are used</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.700" end="00:00:53.100" style="s2">to it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.300" end="00:01:00.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what is this thing?</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.300" end="00:01:02.800" style="s2">Is that thing even gold?</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.500" end="00:01:06.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father made it, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.800" end="00:01:06.199" style="s2">You know to May Street.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.100" end="00:01:15.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One word and you leave tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.200" end="00:01:21.800" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.000" end="00:01:21.800" style="s2">A floor girl who knows her floor.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.100" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will eat here too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.500" end="00:01:53.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your fine dress will get dirty down</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.200" end="00:01:57.700" style="s2">here, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.200" end="00:01:57.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are down here, so it is not dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.300" end="00:02:05.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ife, get up that floor.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.492" end="00:02:05.692" style="s2">You will smell like her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.092" end="00:02:11.092" style="s2">I said get up.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.992" end="00:02:13.792" style="s2">Is this what she teaches you in one day?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.092" end="00:02:16.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She did not teach me anything. I came by</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.792" end="00:02:16.392" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.292" end="00:02:22.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Babe, maybe just leave the child for</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.092" end="00:02:25.192" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.292" end="00:02:25.192" style="s2">Mind your plate.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.392" end="00:02:36.692" style="s2">Darling,</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.692" end="00:02:36.692" style="s2">you are home early.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.092" end="00:02:43.292" style="s2">My fiance, this is his house and</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.492" end="00:02:46.592" style="s2">everything in it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.292" end="00:02:46.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is my daughter on the floor?</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:55.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling, it is the new girl. She begged</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.892" end="00:02:55.292" style="s2">me to let her eat down there.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.292" end="00:03:02.392" style="s2">A village custom, she said, where her</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.492" end="00:03:02.392" style="s2">madam sits.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.492" end="00:03:09.892" style="s2">I could not stop her and then Ife joined</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.392" end="00:03:11.092" style="s2">because Ife joins everything.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.892" end="00:03:14.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is true.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.092" end="00:03:14.592" style="s2">She went down there by herself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.592" end="00:03:24.092" style="s2">Is that so? You asked for the floor?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.692" end="00:03:33.292" style="s2">What is your name?</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.892" end="00:03:35.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.292" end="00:03:36.992" style="s2">Today is my first day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.492" end="00:03:39.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your first day</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.992" end="00:03:41.992" style="s2">and you are eating on the marble.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.992" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is shy, darling. Girls from the</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.992" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">village are always shy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.192" end="00:04:00.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where my daughter eats, I eat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.592" end="00:04:10.194" style="s2">Please, everybody eat. Nobody at that</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.994" end="00:04:10.194" style="s2">table should wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.894" end="00:04:33.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not jump child. I am his mother.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.594" end="00:04:36.594" style="s2">Kayode&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.294" end="00:04:38.694" style="s2">I watched all of it from the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.594" end="00:04:41.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening ma. I am sorry for the</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.694" end="00:04:44.294" style="s2">trouble at your dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.194" end="00:04:44.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who put you on that floor?</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.194" end="00:04:50.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I sat there myself ma.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.394" end="00:04:51.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lie badly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.394" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.594" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">A good liar frightens me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.594" end="00:05:05.794" style="s2">Who is the patient?</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.794" end="00:05:07.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother ma.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.794" end="00:05:11.394" style="s2">They operated on her last week. They</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.494" end="00:05:11.394" style="s2">keep her bed only while I pay in parts.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.194" end="00:05:16.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that is why you swallowed your rice</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.094" end="00:05:18.894" style="s2">on my marble.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.194" end="00:05:21.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need this work ma. Please do not tell</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.894" end="00:05:23.094" style="s2">anybody I said anything.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.294" end="00:05:25.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said nothing. I heard it very</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.094" end="00:05:25.594" style="s2">clearly.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.294" end="00:05:30.794" style="s2">From tomorrow you are not the maid.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.694" end="00:05:32.194" style="s2">You are Ife&#39;s nanny.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.794" end="00:05:35.894" style="s2">Four women</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.194" end="00:05:38.294" style="s2">her stepmother to be hired for her</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.894" end="00:05:39.894" style="s2">and that child would not sit near one of</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.294" end="00:05:44.194" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.894" end="00:05:46.694" style="s2">Tonight she carried her mother&#39;s plate</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.194" end="00:05:49.294" style="s2">the whole length of my table to sit</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.694" end="00:05:49.294" style="s2">beside you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.594" end="00:05:56.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma I came here to scrub floors. I have</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.394" end="00:05:56.094" style="s2">never looked after a rich man&#39;s child.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.194" end="00:06:01.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You looked after her tonight. You moved</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.194" end="00:06:01.394" style="s2">your bowl to give her room.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.694" end="00:06:08.695" style="s2">40 years I have watched people at that</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.895" end="00:06:11.995" style="s2">table and nobody moves their bowl.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.695" end="00:06:11.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam will not like it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.495" end="00:06:17.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam is not yet a wife in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.295" end="00:06:21.795" style="s2">I am still its mother.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.595" end="00:06:37.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother is healing well my dear, but</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.995" end="00:06:37.295" style="s2">you know how this place works.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.295" end="00:06:43.895" style="s2">The bed stays only while the bill comes</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.195" end="00:06:43.895" style="s2">in parts.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.495" end="00:06:50.695" style="s2">If the parts stop, matron will move her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.295" end="00:06:52.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The parts will not stop. I have work now</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.695" end="00:06:54.395" style="s2">mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.095" end="00:06:57.495" style="s2">A nanny job in a big house in Ikoyi for</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.395" end="00:06:57.495" style="s2">a little girl of six.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.695" end="00:07:00.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nanny?</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.795" end="00:07:03.395" style="s2">Me maid.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.995" end="00:07:06.095" style="s2">On Friday I was a maid. Last night I was</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.395" end="00:07:06.095" style="s2">promoted.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.295" end="00:07:11.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promoted on the first day. Your father</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.495" end="00:07:11.295" style="s2">would have laughed.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.195" end="00:07:19.295" style="s2">When he died, his brothers took his shop</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.995" end="00:07:19.295" style="s2">and his tools on Goldsmith&#39;s Road.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.509" end="00:07:21.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.695" end="00:07:27.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember mummy. I was standing at the</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.595" end="00:07:27.195" style="s2">door when they carried his bench out.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.495" end="00:07:32.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His polishing cloth, you still carry it?</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.195" end="00:07:34.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every day.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.495" end="00:07:37.495" style="s2">A rich woman asked me last night if this</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.395" end="00:07:39.595" style="s2">star was even gold.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.495" end="00:07:42.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then rub it in front of her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.595" end="00:07:45.695" style="s2">Your father used to say it at his bench.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.895" end="00:07:48.985" style="s2">Real gold is not afraid of the cloth.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.695" end="00:07:51.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will not be afraid either mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.985" end="00:07:51.005" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.695" end="00:08:00.095" style="s2">The account office printed it this</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.295" end="00:08:00.095" style="s2">morning. I am sorry my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.697" end="00:08:21.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 13 pieces. Count them, madam, so that</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.297" end="00:08:21.097" style="s2">nobody ever says I lost one.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.497" end="00:08:27.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I counted them in August when I brought</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.697" end="00:08:29.197" style="s2">them to you. They look happier here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.297" end="00:08:30.497" style="s2">They look happier here than in that old</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.197" end="00:08:33.697" style="s2">woman&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.497" end="00:08:36.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They look like 180 million naira.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.697" end="00:08:39.497" style="s2">I do not wear emeralds, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.297" end="00:08:39.497" style="s2">I wear interest.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.697" end="00:08:47.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I borrowed 180 million against them</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.197" end="00:08:47.897" style="s2">to cover my company&#39;s losses.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.397" end="00:08:53.797" style="s2">I had copies made, very good copies, and</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.097" end="00:08:56.506" style="s2">I put the copies back in my mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.797" end="00:08:56.506" style="s2">safe. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.697" end="00:09:02.997" style="s2">Copies sit in the box. The real ones sit</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.497" end="00:09:02.997" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.397" end="00:09:10.997" style="s2">Nobody looks inside a clasp.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.697" end="00:09:10.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say it plainly for me, Madam Sade.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.897" end="00:09:16.097" style="s2">When is my money?</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.197" end="00:09:17.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday after next is the engagement</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.097" end="00:09:19.097" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.097" end="00:09:21.397" style="s2">That night I become a signatory on his</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.097" end="00:09:23.997" style="s2">late wife&#39;s foundation account.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.397" end="00:09:26.897" style="s2">Monday you have your money.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:28.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Monday. I like Monday very much.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.897" end="00:09:30.497" style="s2">The Monday after it I would not like at</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.797" end="00:09:32.397" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.497" end="00:09:34.397" style="s2">Neither would you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.397" end="00:09:36.397" style="s2">And if anybody looks inside your clasps</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.397" end="00:09:37.897" style="s2">before Monday?</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.397" end="00:09:40.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it will be somebody who already</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.897" end="00:09:40.897" style="s2">sits on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.497" end="00:09:56.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 13 on my tray. The old woman said was</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.097" end="00:09:59.897" style="s2">14.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.897" end="00:10:02.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One stays with me</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.897" end="00:10:02.497" style="s2">for luck.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.497" end="00:10:15.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was my mummy&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.498" end="00:10:18.498" style="s2">I eat only from this one.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.198" end="00:10:20.998" style="s2">Nobody else is allowed to wash it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.498" end="00:10:23.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will wash it myself</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.998" end="00:10:26.498" style="s2">with my own hands</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.198" end="00:10:28.798" style="s2">every morning and every night.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.498" end="00:10:31.427" style="s2">And I promise you it will never go near</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.798" end="00:10:33.447" style="s2">a floor again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.427" end="00:10:33.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.047" end="00:10:36.067" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.298" end="00:10:42.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, small madam. Good morning,</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.498" end="00:10:44.398" style="s2">new nanny. Me na Ebuka, chef of this</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.698" end="00:10:44.998" style="s2">house for 11 years</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.398" end="00:10:47.398" style="s2">since</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.998" end="00:10:50.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, Ebuka.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.398" end="00:10:52.598" style="s2">I am Tolani.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.098" end="00:10:55.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. The whole compound know. Since</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.598" end="00:10:57.698" style="s2">last night, gate men they talk, drivers</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.398" end="00:10:59.298" style="s2">they talk, even the security dog they</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.698" end="00:11:02.198" style="s2">listen.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.298" end="00:11:04.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what are they all saying?</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.198" end="00:11:06.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want am plain or you want am like</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.298" end="00:11:08.598" style="s2">soup?</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.298" end="00:11:11.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like soup, please.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.598" end="00:11:13.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meeting three bead and must on your</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.398" end="00:11:15.367" style="s2">collets.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.347" end="00:11:15.367" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.967" end="00:11:20.098" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.898" end="00:11:21.698" style="s2">Then add one small girl wey carry her</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.098" end="00:11:24.098" style="s2">plate go floor.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.698" end="00:11:27.098" style="s2">Na so the soup they taste this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.098" end="00:11:27.098" style="s2">E hot well well.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.498" end="00:11:31.798" style="s2">That plate never come out this room for</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.598" end="00:11:34.698" style="s2">two years, nanny.</p>
