<p begin="00:24:02.906" end="00:24:05.806" style="s2">one spreading it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.906" end="00:24:11.406" style="s2">I have been in this house one week,</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.706" end="00:24:13.906" style="s2">Ebuka. I cannot be the girl from the</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.406" end="00:24:13.906" style="s2">video.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.106" end="00:24:20.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oga never look Instagram for him life.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.406" end="00:24:22.206" style="s2">Him only look sheep.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.106" end="00:24:24.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, then look at your eggs. They are</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.206" end="00:24:24.706" style="s2">burning.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.706" end="00:24:33.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take Take madam, add one phone, garnish</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.107" end="00:24:36.307" style="s2">with foolishness, serve hot to 100,000</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.908" end="00:24:36.307" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.351" end="00:24:40.372" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.408" end="00:24:56.908" style="s2">Your lunch oga, jollof with fish the way</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.807" end="00:24:58.707" style="s2">madam Ifeoma&#39;s mother liked them.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.908" end="00:25:01.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you Ebuka.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.707" end="00:25:01.908" style="s2">You have forgotten your phone.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.007" end="00:25:05.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big reveal tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.962" end="00:25:21.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.107" end="00:25:23.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She told my guests it was a village</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.807" end="00:25:25.707" style="s2">custom.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.707" end="00:25:28.408" style="s2">She stood in my dining room</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.707" end="00:25:30.507" style="s2">and said the girl begged her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.408" end="00:25:32.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oga, I no dey inside dining room that</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.507" end="00:25:34.607" style="s2">night but the whole house don see this</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.207" end="00:25:34.607" style="s2">video.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.607" end="00:25:40.107" style="s2">The whole house saw it and nobody told</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.908" end="00:25:40.107" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.207" end="00:25:47.507" style="s2">Oga, the new girl needed the job more</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.507" end="00:25:49.408" style="s2">than she needed to be right. Who go tell</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.507" end="00:25:51.707" style="s2">you? Me? I get three children for</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.408" end="00:25:51.707" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.908" end="00:25:56.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When is madam back?</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.807" end="00:25:59.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This evening oga, she dey taste cake for</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.507" end="00:25:59.007" style="s2">Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.207" end="00:26:17.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Play it for me Sade, then show me which</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.307" end="00:26:17.507" style="s2">part is a village custom.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.707" end="00:26:29.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My hands were shaking. My first dinner</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.207" end="00:26:30.707" style="s2">as almost a mother, eight people</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.107" end="00:26:32.609" style="s2">watching me</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.707" end="00:26:35.209" style="s2">and I said a stupid thing to look</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.609" end="00:26:35.209" style="s2">strong.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.609" end="00:26:41.809" style="s2">I swear to you, I will change.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.909" end="00:26:43.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are apologizing to me. The woman you</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.809" end="00:26:45.809" style="s2">put on the floor is standing at that</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.409" end="00:26:45.809" style="s2">sink.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.809" end="00:26:55.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.609" end="00:26:57.909" style="s2">from my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.109" end="00:26:57.909" style="s2">Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.809" end="00:27:05.909" style="s2">A little something</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.809" end="00:27:05.909" style="s2">for your mother&#39;s medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.909" end="00:27:15.809" style="s2">Keep it, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.909" end="00:27:15.809" style="s2">Sorry is not a plate you can pay for.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.109" end="00:27:21.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One chance, Sade.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.509" end="00:27:23.209" style="s2">Until the engagement dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.409" end="00:27:25.109" style="s2">If my daughter sees one more floor,</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.209" end="00:27:26.709" style="s2">there is no dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.109" end="00:27:29.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand, darling. Thank you for</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.709" end="00:27:29.409" style="s2">believing me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.009" end="00:27:43.109" style="s2">You have cost me one night. I will take</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.209" end="00:27:43.109" style="s2">your whole life.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.509" end="00:27:57.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm, child. The bank writes letters for</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.009" end="00:27:58.809" style="s2">aunts. Read me the small print at the</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.409" end="00:28:00.909" style="s2">bottom.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.809" end="00:28:03.009" style="s2">My glasses have retired without telling</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.909" end="00:28:03.009" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.209" end="00:28:11.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It says the bank can valuement at no</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.309" end="00:28:13.309" style="s2">charge to you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.509" end="00:28:16.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.309" end="00:28:16.709" style="s2">That is what I wanted to hear.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.409" end="00:28:25.909" style="s2">The points are even. Nobody makes the</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.709" end="00:28:28.609" style="s2">points even anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.909" end="00:28:31.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father, ma,</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.609" end="00:28:33.610" style="s2">he had a bench on Goldsmith&#39;s Row.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.909" end="00:28:37.410" style="s2">When he died, his brothers took the</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.610" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">bench, the tools, even the sign.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.410" end="00:28:42.810" style="s2">They said a girl cannot hold the hammer.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.310" end="00:28:45.110" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.810" end="00:28:48.010" style="s2">Did you hold it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.110" end="00:28:50.310" style="s2">Every evening from when I was small,</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.010" end="00:28:51.910" style="s2">he let me do the clasps</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.310" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">because my fingers were thinner than</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.910" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">his.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.510" end="00:29:03.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A child who washes her hands well will</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.710" end="00:29:05.810" style="s2">eat with elders.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.410" end="00:29:08.610" style="s2">Your hands are clean, Tolani.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.810" end="00:29:11.410" style="s2">Some people will not see it at first.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.610" end="00:29:15.510" style="s2">In the [music] end, they will.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.410" end="00:29:15.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma. I will remember it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.010" end="00:29:22.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have been thinking about my emeralds.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.810" end="00:29:24.610" style="s2">40 years in that safe.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.810" end="00:29:25.910" style="s2">I have decided they will not go to a</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.610" end="00:29:28.610" style="s2">bride at all.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.910" end="00:29:31.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not to a bride, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.610" end="00:29:35.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow at lunch, I will say something</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.010" end="00:29:35.310" style="s2">that will spoil a certain appetite.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.210" end="00:29:50.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit, please. You have been standing in</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.810" end="00:29:50.810" style="s2">my house for a week.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.910" end="00:29:58.110" style="s2">When my wife died,</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.410" end="00:30:00.010" style="s2">I went to the ports and I did not come</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.110" end="00:30:01.910" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.010" end="00:30:05.210" style="s2">Not truly.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.910" end="00:30:05.210" style="s2">I left at 5:00 in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.810" end="00:30:09.510" style="s2">I came home at 11:00 at night.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.210" end="00:30:14.610" style="s2">Ife ate with the cook,</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.310" end="00:30:16.310" style="s2">with the drivers,</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.610" end="00:30:18.810" style="s2">with whichever nanny had not resigned</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.310" end="00:30:18.810" style="s2">that month.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.610" end="00:30:22.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She told me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.010" end="00:30:28.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sade said she would manage the house,</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.710" end="00:30:31.710" style="s2">and I let her because it meant I did not</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.910" end="00:30:31.710" style="s2">have to empty chair.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.510" end="00:30:36.612" style="s2">I let other people set my daughter&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.312" end="00:30:36.612" style="s2">table.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.112" end="00:30:46.312" style="s2">That night, on the floor beside her,</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.112" end="00:30:49.712" style="s2">was the first meal I had eaten with my</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.312" end="00:30:49.712" style="s2">own child in four months.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.512" end="00:30:55.712" style="s2">Four months.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.712" end="00:30:59.112" style="s2">And I needed a stranger to sit on my</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.712" end="00:31:00.212" style="s2">marble before I remembered where to sit.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.112" end="00:31:03.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.212" end="00:31:06.912" style="s2">the floor was not the worst of it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.312" end="00:31:06.912" style="s2">I have eaten on floors before.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.212" end="00:31:11.112" style="s2">The worst was that she saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.812" end="00:31:15.812" style="s2">Children remember where you made them</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.412" end="00:31:15.812" style="s2">sit.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.181" end="00:31:24.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.512" end="00:31:25.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you eating with us tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.712" end="00:31:28.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.812" end="00:31:28.612" style="s2">and every night.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.412" end="00:31:51.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My first month&#39;s pay from the house paid</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.712" end="00:31:53.512" style="s2">early.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.712" end="00:31:55.212" style="s2">It is half of what I planned. There was</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.512" end="00:31:57.912" style="s2">a deduction.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.212" end="00:32:00.212" style="s2">It is money, my dear, and you worked for</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.912" end="00:32:00.212" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.612" end="00:32:07.412" style="s2">But I must tell you plainly, the rest</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.712" end="00:32:07.412" style="s2">must be cleared by Friday the 14th.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.212" end="00:32:12.712" style="s2">After that, matron moves your mother out</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.112" end="00:32:12.712" style="s2">of the ward.</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.812" end="00:32:16.812" style="s2">Friday the 14th, I heard you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.712" end="00:32:26.512" style="s2">This house where you work, are they kind</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.412" end="00:32:29.312" style="s2">to you?</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.512" end="00:32:31.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The child is kind, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.312" end="00:32:33.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the madam?</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.212" end="00:32:35.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The madam is getting engaged on Saturday</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.112" end="00:32:35.812" style="s2">the 15th.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.012" end="00:32:38.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not an answer, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.412" end="00:32:41.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.713" end="00:32:41.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the only one I have today. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.227" end="00:32:54.247" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.113" end="00:33:15.213" style="s2">Before the meat goes cold, and I want</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.313" end="00:33:16.513" style="s2">everybody to swallow first.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.213" end="00:33:20.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.513" end="00:33:20.213" style="s2">somebody at this table chokes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.013" end="00:33:28.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then chew slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.913" end="00:33:31.013" style="s2">The family emeralds will not pass to a</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.613" end="00:33:34.513" style="s2">bride on Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.013" end="00:33:37.713" style="s2">They go into Ife&#39;s trust in her name</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.513" end="00:33:37.713" style="s2">until she is grown.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.613" end="00:33:45.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, that set always goes to the wife.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.913" end="00:33:47.713" style="s2">You said so yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.613" end="00:33:50.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said it last week.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.713" end="00:33:53.713" style="s2">A wife can leave a house.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.513" end="00:33:56.213" style="s2">A daughter is the house.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.713" end="00:33:59.713" style="s2">And the bank is sending its valuer here</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.213" end="00:34:01.913" style="s2">on Thursday, the 13th at noon.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.713" end="00:34:03.013" style="s2">He will weigh every piece and open every</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.913" end="00:34:05.013" style="s2">clasp.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.013" end="00:34:06.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, the box is family. Why bring a</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.013" end="00:34:09.113" style="s2">stranger to it?</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.813" end="00:34:12.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because family is exactly who I do not</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.113" end="00:34:12.313" style="s2">trust with arithmetic.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.113" end="00:34:22.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be in Abuja that morning for the</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.713" end="00:34:22.813" style="s2">hearing, so you will receive him, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.013" end="00:34:29.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have received worse men than a valuer</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.513" end="00:34:32.913" style="s2">in this dining room.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.913" end="00:34:32.913" style="s2">One of them I married.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.313" end="00:34:39.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, mama. Whatever keeps Ife</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.313" end="00:34:39.713" style="s2">safe.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.513" end="00:34:46.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last night, I promised somebody this</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.914" end="00:34:50.114" style="s2">lunch would spoil an appetite.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.214" end="00:34:50.114" style="s2">I did not expect it so quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.014" end="00:35:03.914" style="s2">Only until Thursday afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.214" end="00:35:06.114" style="s2">The valuer weighs the real pieces at</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.914" end="00:35:08.414" style="s2">noon and by evening your tray is full</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.114" end="00:35:08.414" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.214" end="00:35:14.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, gold that leaves my table comes</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.814" end="00:35:16.914" style="s2">back lighter.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.414" end="00:35:20.414" style="s2">Always.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.914" end="00:35:20.414" style="s2">Sometimes by one earring.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.514" end="00:35:24.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will have my word on it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.714" end="00:35:26.914" style="s2">You can hold my car as well if you want</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.614" end="00:35:26.914" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.914" end="00:35:34.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your car already belongs to a bank.</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.714" end="00:35:36.814" style="s2">I checked.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.814" end="00:35:39.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then give me two more weeks after Monday</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.814" end="00:35:41.014" style="s2">with interest on top.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.614" end="00:35:43.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.014" end="00:35:46.314" style="s2">All of it. I said Monday last week and I</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.914" end="00:35:49.614" style="s2">say Monday again tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.314" end="00:35:51.214" style="s2">If Monday passes I will not call you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.614" end="00:35:53.614" style="s2">I will walk into that engagement dinner</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.214" end="00:35:56.014" style="s2">myself and ask the old woman for my</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.614" end="00:35:59.014" style="s2">money in front of her guests.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.014" end="00:35:59.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You would not dare.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.114" end="00:36:04.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.614" end="00:36:04.914" style="s2">I keep your voice notes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.414" end="00:36:09.214" style="s2">Everyone and every word you say at my</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.914" end="00:36:11.014" style="s2">table.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.214" end="00:36:13.614" style="s2">A man who keeps voice notes dares a</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.014" end="00:36:13.614" style="s2">great deal.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.714" end="00:36:29.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then by Thursday noon somebody else will</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.814" end="00:36:29.714" style="s2">have stolen it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.514" end="00:36:38.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is mummy on her wedding day.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.914" end="00:36:41.014" style="s2">Grandma says she was the most beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.514" end="00:36:44.114" style="s2">bride in Lagos and Grandma does not say</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.014" end="00:36:47.914" style="s2">that about anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.114" end="00:36:47.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money spent in tea to cut and</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.216" end="00:36:51.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A gogri.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.716" end="00:37:02.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what is this small tree on the</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.216" end="00:37:04.016" style="s2">clasp, my dear?</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.416" end="00:37:06.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is the palm.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.016" end="00:37:08.916" style="s2">Grandma says the palm means the gold</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.416" end="00:37:12.716" style="s2">belongs to this house.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.916" end="00:37:16.816" style="s2">Every piece has one hiding inside.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.716" end="00:37:16.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it is a very good hiding place.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.916" end="00:37:21.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie Sade wore the gold for her</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.016" end="00:37:24.916" style="s2">photos.</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.716" end="00:37:26.516" style="s2">She did not let me touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.916" end="00:37:28.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma has asked me to clean the whole</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.516" end="00:37:32.016" style="s2">set on Wednesday night before the man</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.616" end="00:37:32.016" style="s2">from the bank comes to wait.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.316" end="00:37:38.116" style="s2">I will make every piece shine for you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.516" end="00:37:40.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you show me the palm when it</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.116" end="00:37:40.716" style="s2">shines?</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.816" end="00:37:45.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will hold it under the lamp for you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.216" end="00:37:53.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie Tolani,</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.016" end="00:37:56.516" style="s2">make it shine like mummy&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.616" end="00:37:56.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.916" end="00:38:09.616" style="s2">14 pieces.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.716" end="00:38:12.316" style="s2">Three brides of this family have worn</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.616" end="00:38:15.716" style="s2">them. Clean them gently.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.316" end="00:38:17.716" style="s2">They are older than this house.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.716" end="00:38:20.516" style="s2">My father cleaned pieces like these at</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.716" end="00:38:20.516" style="s2">his bench, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.116" end="00:38:25.416" style="s2">I know how to be gentle.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.716" end="00:38:40.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it? Why have you stopped?</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.316" end="00:38:40.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, may I borrow your glasses?</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.617" end="00:38:55.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, there is no palm in this clasp.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.017" end="00:38:56.917" style="s2">This is brass under gold, and the stones</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.117" end="00:39:00.217" style="s2">are green glass.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.917" end="00:39:01.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look again, child. Look properly.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.217" end="00:39:04.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have looked, ma, and it was made on</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.917" end="00:39:04.817" style="s2">Goldsmiths&#39; Row.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.517" end="00:39:11.517" style="s2">Every bench there signs inside the clasp</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.417" end="00:39:14.317" style="s2">where the buyer never looks.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.517" end="00:39:15.917" style="s2">This crescent is somebody&#39;s mark.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.317" end="00:39:18.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I told me your father&#39;s saying,</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.917" end="00:39:20.017" style="s2">child, real gold is not afraid of the</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.517" end="00:39:22.017" style="s2">cloth.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.017" end="00:39:25.317" style="s2">This one is.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.017" end="00:39:26.917" style="s2">Let me count who has touched this box.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.317" end="00:39:29.617" style="s2">Myself,</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.917" end="00:39:31.217" style="s2">my son, who cannot tell gold from</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.617" end="00:39:34.117" style="s2">groundnut,</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.217" end="00:39:35.817" style="s2">and Sade in August for her proposal</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.117" end="00:39:38.817" style="s2">photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.817" end="00:39:41.317" style="s2">She kept it one whole week.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.817" end="00:39:42.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am only the nanny, ma. I will not say</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.317" end="00:39:44.017" style="s2">a name.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.417" end="00:39:46.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do not need to.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.017" end="00:39:46.917" style="s2">I have said it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.817" end="00:39:58.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should we wake your son, ma? Should we</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.317" end="00:40:00.717" style="s2">call the police tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.417" end="00:40:02.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow at noon, the valuer writes it</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.717" end="00:40:06.217" style="s2">on paper.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.217" end="00:40:06.217" style="s2">With his paper, we speak.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.917" end="00:40:10.917" style="s2">Without it, it is a maid&#39;s word against</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.517" end="00:40:12.417" style="s2">a bride&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.917" end="00:40:15.517" style="s2">And you know which one the police will</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.417" end="00:40:18.117" style="s2">carry out of this house.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.517" end="00:40:22.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will say nothing until noon.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.117" end="00:40:22.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until noon, not one minute before.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.917" end="00:40:43.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, it is past midnight. Either you</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.617" end="00:40:45.517" style="s2">have my money or you have a story.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.217" end="00:40:48.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old woman knows. The maid found it</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.517" end="00:40:49.817" style="s2">tonight with a rag. A rag, can you</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.417" end="00:40:51.318" style="s2">believe it?</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.817" end="00:40:52.518" style="s2">She is a goldsmith&#39;s daughter. Can you</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.318" end="00:40:56.018" style="s2">believe it?</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.518" end="00:40:56.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then your Monday is in trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.118" end="00:40:58.618" style="s2">And so are you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.618" end="00:41:00.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.618" end="00:41:04.318" style="s2">Listen to me. A goldsmith&#39;s daughter has</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.918" end="00:41:04.318" style="s2">the perfect hands for a swap.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.518" end="00:41:14.718" style="s2">In the morning he is in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.018" end="00:41:14.718" style="s2">By 11 before the valuer gold.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.918" end="00:41:20.418" style="s2">And the police will find where she hid</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.518" end="00:41:22.518" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.418" end="00:41:23.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hid what, madam? The gold is sitting on</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.518" end="00:41:26.818" style="s2">my tray.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.918" end="00:41:26.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.018" end="00:41:39.918" style="s2">That earring is part of my security.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.318" end="00:41:42.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That earring is going to buy you your</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.918" end="00:41:42.418" style="s2">Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.818" end="00:42:11.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, before you go, there is something</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.018" end="00:42:11.718" style="s2">about the box in your mother&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.718" end="00:42:16.918" style="s2">With the valuer&#39;s paper at noon, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.218" end="00:42:18.918" style="s2">Not with a frightened girl&#39;s guess at</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.918" end="00:42:20.818" style="s2">dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.918" end="00:42:22.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you two have been whispering since</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.818" end="00:42:24.018" style="s2">last night.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.418" end="00:42:27.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go to your hearing. By lunch you will</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.018" end="00:42:27.118" style="s2">have the whole story.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.218" end="00:42:32.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then call me at the break. Once I sit</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.018" end="00:42:35.318" style="s2">down at 10:00</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.318" end="00:42:35.318" style="s2">they will not let me out.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.618" end="00:42:41.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani,</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.718" end="00:42:43.518" style="s2">keep Ife close until I am back on Friday</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.218" end="00:42:45.318" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.518" end="00:42:46.718" style="s2">Whatever happens in this house, she</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.318" end="00:42:49.718" style="s2">stays with you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.718" end="00:42:51.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She will not leave my side, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.718" end="00:42:55.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you see your mother at 7:00 as we</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.920" end="00:42:55.720" style="s2">agreed and be back before noon.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.020" end="00:42:59.420" style="s2">I want you beside me when that man opens</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.020" end="00:43:03.220" style="s2">the box.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.420" end="00:43:03.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be back long before noon, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.920" end="00:43:28.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Akara at seven in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.135" end="00:43:36.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.520" end="00:43:38.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody, mummy. Called three hours so I</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.620" end="00:43:40.740" style="s2">came to feed you myself.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.720" end="00:43:40.740" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.320" end="00:43:46.520" style="s2">Nurse, please.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.020" end="00:43:46.520" style="s2">Only until the end of the month.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.420" end="00:43:55.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dear,</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.620" end="00:43:59.120" style="s2">I begged matron for you yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.020" end="00:43:59.120" style="s2">Friday is the most she will give.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.020" end="00:44:04.120" style="s2">Friday the 14th, the full balance or</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.220" end="00:44:07.620" style="s2">your mother waits outside the ward.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.120" end="00:44:07.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Friday. Thank [music] you, nurse.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.160" end="00:44:12.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.815" end="00:44:12.835" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.120" end="00:44:17.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are rubbing that cloth as if you</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.520" end="00:44:19.520" style="s2">want to rub a hole in it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.020" end="00:44:21.920" style="s2">What has happened in that house?</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.520" end="00:44:23.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something I cannot say yet, mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.920" end="00:44:26.320" style="s2">At noon, a man from the bank will write</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.420" end="00:44:26.320" style="s2">the truth on paper.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.320" end="00:44:33.020" style="s2">By tonight, I will have good news.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.220" end="00:44:34.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go and stand beside your paper.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.020" end="00:44:37.920" style="s2">Your father never left a piece half</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.720" end="00:44:37.920" style="s2">finished on his bench.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.420" end="00:44:56.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Small madam,</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.720" end="00:44:59.121" style="s2">you no go you no go believe what thing I</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.821" end="00:44:59.121" style="s2">dey see.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.321" end="00:45:02.521" style="s2">Madam Sade dey come out from the boys</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.121" end="00:45:04.321" style="s2">quarters.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.521" end="00:45:05.721" style="s2">8 o&#39;clock in the morning with her big</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.321" end="00:45:08.121" style="s2">bag.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.721" end="00:45:10.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie Sade never goes to the quarters.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.121" end="00:45:11.921" style="s2">She says it smells of pepper.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.721" end="00:45:13.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.921" end="00:45:15.221" style="s2">Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.321" end="00:45:16.521" style="s2">Since when madam dey visit poor people</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.221" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">for morning?</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.521" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">Even sun never wake finish.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.521" end="00:45:25.621" style="s2">Na so madam we no dey enter kitchen. Now</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.521" end="00:45:27.121" style="s2">she dey waka for backyard before sun</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.621" end="00:45:29.821" style="s2">wake.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.121" end="00:45:32.036" style="s2">This window don see plenty things.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.821" end="00:45:32.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does that mean Uncle Ebuka?</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.036" end="00:45:34.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.821" end="00:45:37.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It means say make you finish your</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.321" end="00:45:37.121" style="s2">conflicts.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.221" end="00:45:41.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Ebuka dey talk rubbish. Good</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.221" end="00:45:42.516" style="s2">morning. Has the man from the bank come</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.321" end="00:45:44.536" style="s2">early?</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.516" end="00:45:44.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.521" end="00:45:52.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax Nanny.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.121" end="00:45:54.321" style="s2">Bank man na noon. Your room get rich</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.521" end="00:45:57.621" style="s2">visitor today.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.321" end="00:45:57.621" style="s2">Maybe she want borrow your fan.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.121" end="00:46:06.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, you promised to do my plates</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.421" end="00:46:06.921" style="s2">before the bank man comes.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.021" end="00:46:23.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, the gold is fake. Somebody has</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.221" end="00:46:23.121" style="s2">swapped your gold.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.121" end="00:46:27.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lower your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.021" end="00:46:33.721" style="s2">And tell me who opened my safe.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.721" end="00:46:35.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did mama. I took it to my jeweler</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.721" end="00:46:38.221" style="s2">friend before that valuer comes to</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.421" end="00:46:38.221" style="s2">insult us.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.721" end="00:46:44.921" style="s2">Brass painted yellow in your family box.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.221" end="00:46:47.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guys, you are not ready for what is</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.921" end="00:46:49.421" style="s2">happening in this house today.</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.821" end="00:46:51.621" style="s2">Put the box down.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.421" end="00:46:54.021" style="s2">The valuer comes at noon.</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.621" end="00:46:56.521" style="s2">We will wait for him.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.021" end="00:46:57.922" style="s2">And give the thief one more hour to run?</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.521" end="00:47:00.323" style="s2">Who did you ask to clean it last night,</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.922" end="00:47:00.323" style="s2">mama?</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.523" end="00:47:04.922" style="s2">A goldsmith&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.422" end="00:47:07.723" style="s2">Who in this house has the hands for a</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.922" end="00:47:07.723" style="s2">thing like this?</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.622" end="00:47:17.523" style="s2">I was sitting beside her the whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.422" end="00:47:20.823" style="s2">And who held the gold, mama? You or her?</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.523" end="00:47:20.823" style="s2">Who opened the clasps?</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.323" end="00:47:26.622" style="s2">Inspector from the Okoye house. Our</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.523" end="00:47:30.622" style="s2">family gold has been stolen. I know who</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.622" end="00:47:32.422" style="s2">did it. Come now and bring your men.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.622" end="00:47:34.323" style="s2">There is nothing in it but my clothes</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.422" end="00:47:37.523" style="s2">and my father&#39;s photograph.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.323" end="00:47:37.523" style="s2">Oh, we will search it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.323" end="00:47:59.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 million naira, give or take.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.023" end="00:48:01.223" style="s2">A goldsmith&#39;s tool roll</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.323" end="00:48:03.622" style="s2">and one earring, madam, that does not</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.223" end="00:48:08.223" style="s2">look like brass to me, brass to me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.622" end="00:48:10.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 13 pieces sold, one kept for luck.</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.223" end="00:48:13.122" style="s2">That is how these people think.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.823" end="00:48:16.922" style="s2">Those things are not mine. I have never</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.122" end="00:48:16.922" style="s2">held that much money in my whole life.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.723" end="00:48:22.823" style="s2">My father&#39;s tools were taken from me 3</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.422" end="00:48:25.922" style="s2">years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.823" end="00:48:28.122" style="s2">I have not held a file since.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.922" end="00:48:30.223" style="s2">Inspector, this girl was at Island</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.122" end="00:48:31.523" style="s2">General at 8:00 this morning beside her</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.223" end="00:48:33.823" style="s2">mother.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.523" end="00:48:35.723" style="s2">I sent her there myself.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.823" end="00:48:37.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you, ma, but the earring was</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.723" end="00:48:40.023" style="s2">under her bed at 11:00.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.622" end="00:48:44.023" style="s2">A room does not fill itself.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.023" end="00:48:44.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then who filled it, mama? Me?</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.723" end="00:48:52.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani, you will come with us to the</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.622" end="00:48:52.223" style="s2">station. Hold out your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.324" end="00:49:10.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon. You remember the flower</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.824" end="00:49:13.824" style="s2">girl from the dinner? This is her. The</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.424" end="00:49:15.924" style="s2">maid who stole a dead woman&#39;s gold.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.824" end="00:49:17.524" style="s2">Is it not the nanny? The one who walks</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.924" end="00:49:19.924" style="s2">the small girl to the gate every</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.524" end="00:49:19.924" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.524" end="00:49:27.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She looked so quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.524" end="00:49:29.924" style="s2">It is always the quiet ones who carry</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.324" end="00:49:29.924" style="s2">the gold.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.424" end="00:49:35.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inspector, please. Not in front of the</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.324" end="00:49:37.324" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.924" end="00:49:40.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep walking, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.324" end="00:49:40.324" style="s2">The van is outside.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.924" end="00:49:54.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything she came with. Check it,</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.624" end="00:49:57.224" style="s2">inspector, in case my gold is hiding in</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.524" end="00:49:57.224" style="s2">her slippers.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.424" end="00:50:02.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is nothing more in it, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.324" end="00:50:04.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then she can keep it. Take your floor</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.324" end="00:50:04.724" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.324" end="00:50:16.424" style="s2">Inspector, I told you inside. This girl</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.324" end="00:50:18.824" style="s2">was at the hospital at 8:00. I will tell</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.424" end="00:50:20.924" style="s2">your superior the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.824" end="00:50:23.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell him at the station, ma. A complaint</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.924" end="00:50:25.724" style="s2">is a complaint.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.024" end="00:50:27.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie Tolani. Auntie Tolani, wait for</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.724" end="00:50:31.424" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.924" end="00:50:34.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay, small madam. Stay with Ebuka.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.424" end="00:50:34.524" style="s2">I beg, no look am.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.324" end="00:50:39.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ife.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.924" end="00:50:45.124" style="s2">Eat from your own plate every night.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.824" end="00:50:46.724" style="s2">Do not let anybody move it. I will come</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.124" end="00:50:48.524" style="s2">back for the plate.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.724" end="00:50:52.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You promise?</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.524" end="00:50:52.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise on my father&#39;s star.</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.024" end="00:51:02.624" style="s2">Say something to your fans, nanny.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.535" end="00:51:21.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.725" end="00:51:24.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, I am seeing it now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.825" end="00:51:27.325" style="s2">Tell me it is not what it looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.725" end="00:51:30.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is exactly what it looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.325" end="00:51:30.625" style="s2">And none of it is true.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.125" end="00:51:34.025" style="s2">Sade called the police before the valuer</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.925" end="00:51:35.625" style="s2">came.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.025" end="00:51:37.625" style="s2">They pulled an earring from under that</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.625" end="00:51:39.325" style="s2">girl&#39;s mattress.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.625" end="00:51:40.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani would not take a spoon from that</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.325" end="00:51:42.425" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.925" end="00:51:44.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.425" end="00:51:47.125" style="s2">Ife knows it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.325" end="00:51:49.425" style="s2">The street does not.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.125" end="00:51:50.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the panel is resuming. If you are</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.425" end="00:51:54.125" style="s2">not in your seat, the commission will</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.925" end="00:51:54.125" style="s2">rule on the license without you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.125" end="00:52:00.525" style="s2">Mama, get her a lawyer, the best one in</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.625" end="00:52:04.025" style="s2">Lagos.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.525" end="00:52:06.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bail, whatever it costs.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.025" end="00:52:08.625" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.125" end="00:52:12.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last flight is at 6:00.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.625" end="00:52:12.125" style="s2">I will be there before midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.925" end="00:52:18.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go and save your 4,000 jobs, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.125" end="00:52:21.125" style="s2">I will save the one that matters to your</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.825" end="00:52:21.125" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.425" end="00:52:37.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you. Even here you choose the</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.525" end="00:52:40.525" style="s2">floor.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.725" end="00:52:40.525" style="s2">What do you want, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.225" end="00:52:47.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will not believe me, but tonight I</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.525" end="00:52:47.325" style="s2">am the only woman in Lagos who can.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.925" end="00:52:52.825" style="s2">Write that you took it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.625" end="00:52:56.525" style="s2">One line.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.825" end="00:52:59.225" style="s2">You were tempted. You are sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.525" end="00:53:00.825" style="s2">Tomorrow I pay your mother&#39;s bill,</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.225" end="00:53:04.425" style="s2">all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.825" end="00:53:07.627" style="s2">And I ask the inspector to be gentle.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.425" end="00:53:09.327" style="s2">You will be out by Christmas.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.627" end="00:53:11.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And my name, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.327" end="00:53:14.827" style="s2">Who pays for my name?</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.927" end="00:53:18.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your name? With a rag and a dead father?</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.827" end="00:53:18.327" style="s2">Your name is worth this paper.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.927" end="00:53:27.227" style="s2">My father&#39;s brothers took his shop, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.727" end="00:53:27.227" style="s2">His bench, his hammer, even his sign.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.727" end="00:53:32.727" style="s2">Nobody will take his name.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.527" end="00:53:35.527" style="s2">I did not take your gold and I will not</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.727" end="00:53:35.527" style="s2">write that I did.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.927" end="00:53:39.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brave girl.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.327" end="00:53:42.427" style="s2">When your mother is sleeping on the</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.527" end="00:53:44.527" style="s2">street, tell her how brave you were.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.427" end="00:53:48.527" style="s2">She will already know.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.527" end="00:53:48.527" style="s2">Then sit on this floor until you rot.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.927" end="00:54:21.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bail is posted, ma. Signed by the madam</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.927" end="00:54:24.127" style="s2">herself. Released pending investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.027" end="00:54:24.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The complaint stands.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.927" end="00:54:32.727" style="s2">Come home, child. Ebuka has kept your</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.227" end="00:54:32.727" style="s2">food warm since 6:00.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.527" end="00:54:39.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which home, mama?</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.827" end="00:54:39.327" style="s2">The one where I ate on the floor?</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.127" end="00:54:45.327" style="s2">Or the one where I left in handcuffs?</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.627" end="00:54:47.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The one where a little girl is still</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.327" end="00:54:50.527" style="s2">sitting up in her bed</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.327" end="00:54:50.527" style="s2">asking the door for you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.127" end="00:55:00.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The agency called me at 9:00.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.527" end="00:55:00.527" style="s2">They have struck my name. Has the video?</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.727" end="00:55:09.728" style="s2">My phone is full of strangers calling me</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.528" end="00:55:13.328" style="s2">thief.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.728" end="00:55:13.328" style="s2">One woman sent me a picture of a mop.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.528" end="00:55:18.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Phones forget.</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.028" end="00:55:20.528" style="s2">Lagos does not. If I walk back through</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.328" end="00:55:23.628" style="s2">that gate, she will say I came back for</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.528" end="00:55:23.628" style="s2">the rest of the gold.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.728" end="00:55:26.928" style="s2">And you will have to choose between your</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.428" end="00:55:28.928" style="s2">son&#39;s bride</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.928" end="00:55:32.328" style="s2">and his daughter&#39;s nanny</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.928" end="00:55:32.328" style="s2">in front of the whole street.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.728" end="00:55:37.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am 68 years old. I choose every</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.028" end="00:55:39.628" style="s2">morning before breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.128" end="00:55:42.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tonight, choose to let me go. My</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.628" end="00:55:42.828" style="s2">mother should hear it from me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.628" end="00:55:50.128" style="s2">Tolani.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.628" end="00:56:02.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It fell in the gutter. I washed it in my</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.128" end="00:56:02.828" style="s2">own sink.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.028" end="00:56:25.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy,</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.128" end="00:56:26.828" style="s2">why are you out here?</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.228" end="00:56:29.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Matron came in the evening with a</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.828" end="00:56:31.328" style="s2">nurse&#39;s phone. She showed me your face</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.128" end="00:56:33.728" style="s2">at that gate.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.328" end="00:56:35.528" style="s2">She said a thief will not pay by Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.728" end="00:56:37.828" style="s2">So why should a thief&#39;s mother keep a</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.528" end="00:56:37.828" style="s2">bed?</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.928" end="00:56:48.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not take it, mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.228" end="00:56:53.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I ask you?</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.028" end="00:56:55.328" style="s2">Your father said real gold is not afraid</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.528" end="00:56:59.628" style="s2">of the cloth.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.328" end="00:56:59.628" style="s2">So why is my gold afraid tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.328" end="00:57:08.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know this hand.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.128" end="00:57:09.929" style="s2">The crescent cut deep on the R are into</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.429" end="00:57:12.529" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.929" end="00:57:12.529" style="s2">Whose hand?</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.429" end="00:57:18.729" style="s2">Crescent and R.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.429" end="00:57:18.729" style="s2">Mommy, that is Rabiu&#39;s mark.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.529" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">Then the gold is not afraid of you, my</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.929" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.829" end="00:57:42.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came straight from the airport.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.729" end="00:57:44.829" style="s2">I sat in a hearing room fighting for a</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.429" end="00:57:47.729" style="s2">license while they put handcuffs on you</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.829" end="00:57:47.729" style="s2">at my own gate.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.429" end="00:57:52.329" style="s2">I left my house in the wrong hands.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.329" end="00:57:53.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.329" end="00:57:56.429" style="s2">you did not put that earring under my</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.729" end="00:57:56.429" style="s2">mattress.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.229" end="00:58:01.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.329" end="00:58:03.129" style="s2">but I gave her the keys and and went to</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.129" end="00:58:06.329" style="s2">sleep in my work.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.129" end="00:58:06.329" style="s2">That one is mine to carry.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.929" end="00:58:14.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whoever did this counted on one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.029" end="00:58:16.329" style="s2">Nobody looks inside a clasp.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.829" end="00:58:19.329" style="s2">I looked.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.329" end="00:58:21.829" style="s2">Your family palm is not there.</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.329" end="00:58:23.929" style="s2">This crescent is Rabiu&#39;s mark</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.829" end="00:58:25.229" style="s2">from Goldsmith&#39;s Row.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.929" end="00:58:27.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.229" end="00:58:30.229" style="s2">Now I will look so that nobody else has</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.129" end="00:58:30.229" style="s2">to take your word for it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.729" end="00:58:42.529" style="s2">Nurse, this woman belongs in a bed,</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.429" end="00:58:44.729" style="s2">not on a bench. Put the bill in my name.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.529" end="00:58:46.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.729" end="00:58:48.129" style="s2">Then write it as an advance on my wages,</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.929" end="00:58:50.829" style="s2">sir.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.129" end="00:58:53.029" style="s2">Only what keeps her in a bed.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.829" end="00:58:55.329" style="s2">The rest I will pay myself.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.029" end="00:58:58.929" style="s2">I will sign for it and I will work it</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.329" end="00:59:00.929" style="s2">back every naira.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.929" end="00:59:04.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is her father&#39;s daughter, sir. He</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.929" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">would not take a free nail from any man.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.529" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nurse, an advance. Bring her the form.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.731" end="00:59:27.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, Goldsmiths Row.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.731" end="00:59:27.331" style="s2">Both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.231" end="00:59:42.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, auntie. Gold for your wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.331" end="00:59:44.731" style="s2">Original. Come and see original.</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.031" end="00:59:46.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will anybody here know my face?</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.731" end="00:59:48.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here they only know gold, sir. Keep your</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.431" end="00:59:50.031" style="s2">cap down and put your watch in your</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.131" end="00:59:52.531" style="s2">pocket, or the price of everything</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.031" end="00:59:52.531" style="s2">doubles.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.131" end="01:00:08.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was his?</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.731" end="01:00:11.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For 31 years.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.131" end="01:00:13.831" style="s2">The shutters are still his.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.031" end="01:00:16.431" style="s2">My uncle&#39;s only changed the paint.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.831" end="01:00:20.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want to stop?</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.431" end="01:00:20.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not today. Today I came to read.</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.931" end="01:00:29.931" style="s2">See the star inside?</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.831" end="01:00:31.231" style="s2">Five points, one longer than the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.931" end="01:00:34.831" style="s2">That was Papa.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.231" end="01:00:34.831" style="s2">His old pieces still come back here.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.431" end="01:00:40.031" style="s2">Star was Papa.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.131" end="01:00:43.431" style="s2">Crescent is rent on this row, signs</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.031" end="01:00:43.431" style="s2">where the buyer never looks.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.131" end="01:00:48.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, you be goldsmith. You dey read</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.131" end="01:00:50.131" style="s2">clasp like newspaper.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.131" end="01:00:53.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father taught me to read gold before</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.131" end="01:00:53.231" style="s2">I could write my name.</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.631" end="01:01:12.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father&#39;s forehead.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.031" end="01:01:16.232" style="s2">You are Tolani. You used to sit under</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.831" end="01:01:18.032" style="s2">his bench, sorting clasps into a tin.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.232" end="01:01:21.732" style="s2">Your papa taught me the crescent when I</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.032" end="01:01:21.732" style="s2">was a boy, sweeping his floor.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.932" end="01:01:27.632" style="s2">He said a goldsmith who will not sign</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.432" end="01:01:30.332" style="s2">his work</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.632" end="01:01:31.932" style="s2">is a thief in a clean shirt.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.332" end="01:01:34.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me who you signed this one</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.932" end="01:01:34.232" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.932" end="01:01:47.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August.</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.032" end="01:01:47.232" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.832" end="01:01:52.932" style="s2">That transfer is from Sade&#39;s account.</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.532" end="01:01:55.432" style="s2">Her full name is on it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.932" end="01:01:58.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The 20th of August, sir. I walked into</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.432" end="01:02:01.632" style="s2">your house on the 1st of November.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.332" end="01:02:02.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two months before you ever saw that box.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.632" end="01:02:05.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who brought the real set for you to</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.932" end="01:02:05.332" style="s2">copy?</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.732" end="01:02:09.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A man in a wine-red blazer.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.732" end="01:02:15.032" style="s2">He carried the real set on a black tray,</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.632" end="01:02:18.832" style="s2">sat on that stool while I took the molds</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.032" end="01:02:18.832" style="s2">and carried every piece away again.</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.032" end="01:02:24.132" style="s2">He left his card in case the copies</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.432" end="01:02:24.132" style="s2">needed repair.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.332" end="01:02:29.432" style="s2">I did not know they would put my brass</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.332" end="01:02:32.732" style="s2">in a dead woman&#39;s box.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.432" end="01:02:32.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And a living girl in a cell.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.032" end="01:02:36.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will say it anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.032" end="01:02:43.532" style="s2">My name is inside that clasp too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.932" end="01:02:46.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the real gold is sitting by the</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.532" end="01:02:46.032" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.293" end="01:02:48.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.032" end="01:03:02.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has the 13 pieces.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.432" end="01:03:03.732" style="s2">I will clear her debt to take my</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.032" end="01:03:06.132" style="s2">family&#39;s gold back</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.732" end="01:03:09.732" style="s2">on one condition.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.132" end="01:03:11.832" style="s2">He brings the set to the dinner himself</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.732" end="01:03:13.832" style="s2">tomorrow at 7</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.832" end="01:03:16.932" style="s2">and tells the truth at that table or he</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.832" end="01:03:17.433" style="s2">answers to the police for stolen gold.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.932" end="01:03:20.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the man in</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.433" end="01:03:22.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; red jacket said,</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.333" end="01:03:25.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That gold has no feelings,</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.533" end="01:03:26.933" style="s2">and neither does he.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.033" end="01:03:29.033" style="s2">He will come.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.933" end="01:03:30.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we do it properly.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.033" end="01:03:33.033" style="s2">The same table,</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.933" end="01:03:34.533" style="s2">the same eight guests from that first</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.033" end="01:03:36.533" style="s2">night,</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.533" end="01:03:39.033" style="s2">and the same inspector who put her in</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.533" end="01:03:39.033" style="s2">the van.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.233" end="01:03:46.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One thing they worry me since Thursday.</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.033" end="01:03:48.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say it, Ebuka.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.533" end="01:03:50.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thursday morning, 8:00 at the wash plate</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.733" end="01:03:51.833" style="s2">for window.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.233" end="01:03:55.133" style="s2">Madam Sade come out from the boys&#39;</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.833" end="01:03:55.133" style="s2">quarters with her big bag.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.233" end="01:04:00.333" style="s2">From Auntie Tolani side, madam we talk</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.033" end="01:04:00.333" style="s2">say quarters they smell of pepper.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.933" end="01:04:08.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 8:00</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.233" end="01:04:10.533" style="s2">while this girl was at the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.133" end="01:04:13.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tomorrow I stand up at that table</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.533" end="01:04:15.333" style="s2">and show them all of it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.333" end="01:04:17.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not show them for me, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.333" end="01:04:18.733" style="s2">Let me show them.</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.133" end="01:04:21.433" style="s2">She put me on that floor in front of</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.733" end="01:04:21.433" style="s2">those guests.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.733" end="01:04:31.133" style="s2">I want the same guests to watch me stand</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.533" end="01:04:31.133" style="s2">up from it</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.733" end="01:04:37.333" style="s2">with my father&#39;s cloth in my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.333" end="01:04:41.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the dinner goes on,</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.333" end="01:04:41.033" style="s2">and Sade must believe I still love her.</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.433" end="01:04:57.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came back so quiet last night. I</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.933" end="01:04:59.733" style="s2">thought you were angry with me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.433" end="01:05:01.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was tired. Abuja takes everything out</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.733" end="01:05:03.533" style="s2">of a man.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.333" end="01:05:05.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the girl? Dupe has posted about her</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.533" end="01:05:07.833" style="s2">twice today.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.833" end="01:05:10.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Felicia why you seen to a notching</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.833" end="01:05:13.433" style="s2">from a Ceritan fish and.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.733" end="01:05:15.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How you trying to</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.433" end="01:05:17.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The foundation papers are on the table</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.233" end="01:05:20.433" style="s2">for after dinner</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.633" end="01:05:20.433" style="s2">in front of everybody.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.333" end="01:05:23.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight everybody</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.135" end="01:05:26.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sees who I am.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.435" end="01:05:28.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Tonight everybody sees exactly who</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.535" end="01:05:28.935" style="s2">you are.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.435" end="01:05:40.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.935" end="01:06:02.135" style="s2">Family, friends, thank you for coming</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.535" end="01:06:03.835" style="s2">back to this table.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.135" end="01:06:06.135" style="s2">Two Saturdays ago we laughed together</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.835" end="01:06:06.135" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.435" end="01:06:11.335" style="s2">Then this week this house was robbed</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.435" end="01:06:11.335" style="s2">from the inside.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.435" end="01:06:21.235" style="s2">The family gold,</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.135" end="01:06:23.035" style="s2">Mama Folake&#39;s emerald stolen by the girl</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.235" end="01:06:24.635" style="s2">we fed.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.035" end="01:06:26.935" style="s2">I took her in,</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.635" end="01:06:28.335" style="s2">I gave her a uniform, I even let her</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.935" end="01:06:31.835" style="s2">near my daughter,</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.335" end="01:06:31.835" style="s2">and she paid us back in brass.</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.535" end="01:06:38.735" style="s2">In this house,</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.335" end="01:06:41.335" style="s2">in this very house, I was the one who</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.735" end="01:06:41.335" style="s2">saw it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.935" end="01:06:47.235" style="s2">Somebody had to be brave,</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.435" end="01:06:49.635" style="s2">and I did not wait for a man to be brave</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.235" end="01:06:49.635" style="s2">for me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.035" end="01:06:57.935" style="s2">So tonight I stand here for Kayode,</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.535" end="01:07:01.535" style="s2">for Mama,</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.935" end="01:07:03.935" style="s2">and for Ife, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.535" end="01:07:06.535" style="s2">From Monday, nothing that belongs to</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.935" end="01:07:08.235" style="s2">this family will ever sit in the wrong</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.535" end="01:07:09.606" style="s2">hands again.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.235" end="01:07:11.626" style="s2">That is my promise at this table.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.606" end="01:07:11.626" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.935" end="01:07:22.035" style="s2">Before the gold changes hands, I have</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.335" end="01:07:22.035" style="s2">one more guest. I invited her myself.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.536" end="01:07:40.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who let the floor in?</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.836" end="01:07:43.536" style="s2">I did. Sit down, Sadi.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.336" end="01:07:43.536" style="s2">It is still my table.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.536" end="01:07:56.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening, mama. May somebody pass me</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.536" end="01:07:56.736" style="s2">a white napkin, please?</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.536" end="01:08:01.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, thank you, sir. I will use my</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.336" end="01:08:01.836" style="s2">father&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.236" end="01:08:13.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is green.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.536" end="01:08:14.936" style="s2">Why is it green?</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.136" end="01:08:16.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because there is brass under that gold,</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.936" end="01:08:20.236" style="s2">sir.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.836" end="01:08:22.036" style="s2">Brass sweats green when you rub it hard.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.236" end="01:08:24.236" style="s2">Real gold gives the cloth nothing at</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.036" end="01:08:24.236" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.136" end="01:08:30.036" style="s2">On Gold&#39;s Row, every man who makes a</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.836" end="01:08:31.936" style="s2">clasp signs inside it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.036" end="01:08:33.236" style="s2">Small, the next goldsmith will ever</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.936" end="01:08:35.836" style="s2">look.</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.236" end="01:08:39.036" style="s2">My father signed with a star.</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.836" end="01:08:40.836" style="s2">This family signs with a palm.</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.036" end="01:08:42.536" style="s2">I saw it in Ife&#39;s mother&#39;s wedding</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.836" end="01:08:44.636" style="s2">photograph.</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.536" end="01:08:46.636" style="s2">This clasp carries a crescent with the</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.636" end="01:08:49.636" style="s2">letter R.</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.636" end="01:08:49.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no palm.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.136" end="01:08:55.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, ma. That crescent belongs to one</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.036" end="01:08:55.836" style="s2">bench on the row.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.436" end="01:09:00.536" style="s2">A man who copies very well</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.836" end="01:09:02.036" style="s2">and who writes down [music] every job he</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.536" end="01:09:04.736" style="s2">takes</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.036" end="01:09:06.736" style="s2">because my father taught him to.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.736" end="01:09:10.236" style="s2">She grew up on that row. Of course she</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.736" end="01:09:10.236" style="s2">knows how to make one herself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.736" end="01:09:17.936" style="s2">I have not held a hammer in 3 years, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.536" end="01:09:17.936" style="s2">My uncles made sure of that.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.536" end="01:09:22.836" style="s2">But nobody could stop me from learning</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.336" end="01:09:22.836" style="s2">to read.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.736" end="01:09:32.637" style="s2">Real gold is not afraid of the cloth.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.938" end="01:09:32.637" style="s2">Neither am my.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.438" end="01:09:41.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening. My name is Rabiu. I make</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.137" end="01:09:44.237" style="s2">copies on Goldsmith&#39;s Row and this is my</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.938" end="01:09:44.237" style="s2">book.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.137" end="01:09:51.338" style="s2">Collected on the 20th of August</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.237" end="01:09:53.237" style="s2">paid by transfer from her own account.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.338" end="01:09:54.637" style="s2">That girl did not enter this house until</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.237" end="01:09:56.637" style="s2">November.</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.637" end="01:09:58.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August, that is before the maid ever</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.637" end="01:10:02.137" style="s2">came.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.038" end="01:10:02.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anybody can buy a book on Lagos Island.</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.038" end="01:10:08.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let us ask the man who holds the</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.838" end="01:10:08.538" style="s2">real gold.</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.938" end="01:10:24.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening, madam. You promised me</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.637" end="01:10:27.338" style="s2">Monday. I came a little early.</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.038" end="01:10:29.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have never seen this man in my life.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.338" end="01:10:31.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw me in August, madam, and again</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.338" end="01:10:33.838" style="s2">this month under candles in Victoria</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.438" end="01:10:33.838" style="s2">Island.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.438" end="01:10:41.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is, ma, the palm.</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.338" end="01:10:47.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband&#39;s mother&#39;s palm.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.738" end="01:10:48.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 13 pieces pledged to me for 80 million</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.038" end="01:10:50.137" style="s2">naira.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.038" end="01:10:52.137" style="s2">The set was 14.</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.137" end="01:10:54.038" style="s2">She kept one earring</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.137" end="01:10:56.038" style="s2">for luck, she said.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.038" end="01:10:57.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have that earring, madam, under the</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.038" end="01:10:59.838" style="s2">mattress of the girl you sent me to</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.338" end="01:10:59.838" style="s2">arrest.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.938" end="01:11:16.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Copies sit in the box. The real ones sit</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.738" end="01:11:16.238" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.738" end="01:11:20.438" style="s2">Nobody looks inside a clasp.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.338" end="01:11:28.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oga, mama, make I talk my own. 8:00</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.438" end="01:11:29.939" style="s2">madam come out from the boys&#39; quarters</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.038" end="01:11:31.739" style="s2">with her big bag.</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.939" end="01:11:34.939" style="s2">I did wash plate for my kitchen window.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.739" end="01:11:34.939" style="s2">I see them with my two eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.739" end="01:11:41.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were paid to keep quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.639" end="01:11:43.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was paid, madam,</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.439" end="01:11:46.339" style="s2">by him</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.839" end="01:11:46.339" style="s2">to talk.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.139" end="01:11:53.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your gold.</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.339" end="01:12:17.239" style="s2">Two Saturdays ago</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.139" end="01:12:20.239" style="s2">at this table</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.239" end="01:12:21.739" style="s2">you said in this house maids eat on the</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.239" end="01:12:23.739" style="s2">floor.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.739" end="01:12:27.339" style="s2">You said it before eight people. Some of</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.739" end="01:12:27.339" style="s2">you are here tonight and you laughed.</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.839" end="01:12:34.139" style="s2">My daughter carried her mother&#39;s plate</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.839" end="01:12:37.739" style="s2">the whole length of this table</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.139" end="01:12:37.739" style="s2">to sit down beside that maid.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.039" end="01:12:41.339" style="s2">And I came home and believed you instead</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.039" end="01:12:43.139" style="s2">of my child.</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.339" end="01:12:45.639" style="s2">I will answer for that.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.139" end="01:12:48.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say the rest, Kayode.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.639" end="01:12:50.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When Ife&#39;s mother was dying</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.139" end="01:12:53.739" style="s2">I promised her I would marry only a</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.039" end="01:12:56.439" style="s2">woman my daughter can sit beside.</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.739" end="01:12:58.739" style="s2">Ife has shown me twice now</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.439" end="01:13:01.739" style="s2">who that is.</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.739" end="01:13:04.439" style="s2">Sade, this engagement ends here</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.739" end="01:13:04.439" style="s2">at this table.</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.339" end="01:13:10.939" style="s2">Tolani,</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.439" end="01:13:10.939" style="s2">sit.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.339" end="01:13:24.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now we eat here.</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.939" end="01:13:24.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kayode.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.539" end="01:13:28.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where will I sit?</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.139" end="01:13:34.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sade, I am not in this. I only came to</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.640" end="01:13:36.740" style="s2">film.</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.440" end="01:13:39.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your chair is empty too, my dear. Post</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.740" end="01:13:39.040" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.336" end="01:13:41.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.840" end="01:14:02.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Theft of this family&#39;s gold, a false</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.140" end="01:14:04.040" style="s2">report to the police,</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.740" end="01:14:05.440" style="s2">and planting evidence in another</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.040" end="01:14:06.940" style="s2">person&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.440" end="01:14:09.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this not the same madam who called</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.940" end="01:14:12.240" style="s2">the maid a thief on this very street two</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.140" end="01:14:12.240" style="s2">days ago, right here?</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.640" end="01:14:22.140" style="s2">Kayode, please.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.240" end="01:14:23.740" style="s2">I was going to pay it back Monday, all</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.140" end="01:14:25.740" style="s2">of it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.740" end="01:14:28.340" style="s2">Nobody would have lost anything. Tell</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.740" end="01:14:30.740" style="s2">them to stop filming me. I am live,</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.340" end="01:14:32.340" style="s2">Sade. You taught me everything for the</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.740" end="01:14:34.540" style="s2">story.</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.340" end="01:14:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked the child to choose between a</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.540" end="01:14:40.140" style="s2">plate and the floor.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.440" end="01:14:41.640" style="s2">She chose.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.140" end="01:14:43.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me to take my floor with me,</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.640" end="01:14:46.440" style="s2">ma. I did.</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.540" end="01:14:46.440" style="s2">It brought me back.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.240" end="01:15:07.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The account office says the last part</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.040" end="01:15:11.440" style="s2">came in this morning. Sign here, mummy,</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.940" end="01:15:11.440" style="s2">and you can stop counting the ceiling.</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.340" end="01:15:15.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paid</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.740" end="01:15:17.740" style="s2">all of it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.340" end="01:15:21.240" style="s2">With what money, Tolani?</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.740" end="01:15:23.540" style="s2">Look at me and tell me the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.240" end="01:15:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With my own hands, mummy, I promise you</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.540" end="01:15:27.040" style="s2">every naira of it is work.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.240" end="01:15:36.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, madam.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.040" end="01:15:39.942" style="s2">I came to meet the woman who raised the</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.542" end="01:15:39.942" style="s2">only honest liar I know.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.242" end="01:15:44.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are welcome, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.142" end="01:15:44.942" style="s2">Please, sit.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.442" end="01:15:51.742" style="s2">Tolani, give mama the good chair.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.542" end="01:15:54.542" style="s2">The bank&#39;s valuer finally came.</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.742" end="01:15:56.642" style="s2">14 pieces, everyone real, every par in</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.542" end="01:15:58.742" style="s2">its place.</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.642" end="01:16:02.542" style="s2">I told him he was late</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.742" end="01:16:02.542" style="s2">and he should be ashamed of himself.</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.942" end="01:16:08.942" style="s2">But this set is too heavy for a child of</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.242" end="01:16:11.742" style="s2">six.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.942" end="01:16:13.542" style="s2">It must be cleaned and reset for Ife</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.742" end="01:16:16.342" style="s2">so that one day she can wear it without</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.542" end="01:16:16.342" style="s2">breaking her neck.</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.042" end="01:16:23.842" style="s2">For that, I want a goldsmith.</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.942" end="01:16:25.642" style="s2">A goldsmith&#39;s work and a goldsmith&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.842" end="01:16:29.142" style="s2">fee.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.642" end="01:16:31.542" style="s2">I paid her the first half on Monday.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.142" end="01:16:33.242" style="s2">So that is the money.</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.542" end="01:16:35.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is the money, mummy.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.242" end="01:16:38.442" style="s2">And the advance Kayode gave me, I have</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.342" end="01:16:38.442" style="s2">started working it back.</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.142" end="01:16:42.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, your husband taught me the</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.942" end="01:16:44.442" style="s2">crescent at his bench.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.842" end="01:16:46.742" style="s2">I have cleared the bench beside mine on</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.442" end="01:16:46.742" style="s2">the row.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.942" end="01:16:54.242" style="s2">His crescent is in my clasp.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.042" end="01:16:54.242" style="s2">Her star will be in this one.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.042" end="01:17:01.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They said a girl cannot hold a</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.342" end="01:17:03.742" style="s2">goldsmith&#39;s hammer.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.542" end="01:17:06.042" style="s2">Then hold ours. You belong to this</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.742" end="01:17:08.742" style="s2">family&#39;s gold now, and it belongs in</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.042" end="01:17:10.242" style="s2">your hands.</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.742" end="01:17:12.742" style="s2">Your father would have closed his his</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.242" end="01:17:15.542" style="s2">shop for one whole day</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.742" end="01:17:15.542" style="s2">just to laugh.</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.143" end="01:17:18.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.742" end="01:17:32.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ife asked me last night if you are</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.142" end="01:17:34.042" style="s2">leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.342" end="01:17:35.742" style="s2">I did not know what to tell her, so I am</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.042" end="01:17:36.443" style="s2">asking you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.742" end="01:17:38.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to this</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.443" end="01:17:41.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; house as a maid, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.143" end="01:17:41.543" style="s2">The maid&#39;s work is finished.</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.943" end="01:17:48.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not asking the maid.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.943" end="01:17:52.443" style="s2">I am asking the woman who mothered my</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.943" end="01:17:52.443" style="s2">daughter when I was not there.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.743" end="01:17:58.543" style="s2">Ife needs you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.743" end="01:17:58.543" style="s2">And so do I.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.643" end="01:18:05.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When they took me through that gate you</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.043" end="01:18:09.243" style="s2">were in Abuja. And her table was in</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.143" end="01:18:09.243" style="s2">another woman&#39;s hands long before that.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.743" end="01:18:14.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I left my daughter&#39;s table to</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.743" end="01:18:17.543" style="s2">other people because it was easier than</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.543" end="01:18:17.543" style="s2">sitting at it myself.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.243" end="01:18:23.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will stay.</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.943" end="01:18:25.343" style="s2">On one condition. Nobody sets your</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.243" end="01:18:28.543" style="s2">daughter&#39;s table but you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.343" end="01:18:29.943" style="s2">And you eat at it every night by seven.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.543" end="01:18:30.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By seven.</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.943" end="01:18:34.343" style="s2">Every night.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.743" end="01:18:34.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even when your ports are on fire?</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.443" end="01:18:38.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ports have managers. Ife has one</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.743" end="01:18:40.694" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.674" end="01:18:40.694" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.643" end="01:18:45.343" style="s2">And you, Ebuka.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.343" end="01:18:47.743" style="s2">11 years in this house.</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.343" end="01:18:49.743" style="s2">And you saw what I did not.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.743" end="01:18:52.243" style="s2">From today you are head of staff in this</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.743" end="01:18:52.243" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.084" end="01:18:55.104" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.543" end="01:18:58.843" style="s2">And that small restaurant on the island</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.143" end="01:19:03.143" style="s2">you keep talking about</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.843" end="01:19:03.143" style="s2">the papers are on my desk. It is yours.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.219" end="01:19:06.239" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.425" end="01:19:13.445" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.443" end="01:19:18.943" style="s2">I will cook for you free every Sunday</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.543" end="01:19:20.343" style="s2">till I die.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.943" end="01:19:22.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.343" end="01:19:24.843" style="s2">Auntie Tolani.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.143" end="01:19:24.843" style="s2">Dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.695" end="01:19:35.715" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.644" end="01:19:53.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not look at me like that, all of you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.945" end="01:19:53.344" style="s2">I am sitting in a chair.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.545" end="01:19:57.545" style="s2">Mine are poor, ma, and they are very</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.445" end="01:19:59.545" style="s2">happy on this mat.</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.545" end="01:20:00.945" style="s2">Who chose the floor tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.545" end="01:20:05.445" style="s2">Me.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.945" end="01:20:05.445" style="s2">Because down here, everybody fits.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.945" end="01:20:14.344" style="s2">Take one family, add one mat, no pepper.</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.144" end="01:20:16.445" style="s2">Na so sweet soup dey.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.344" end="01:20:19.744" style="s2">11 years you have put pepper in</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.445" end="01:20:22.545" style="s2">everything, Ebuka.</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.744" end="01:20:24.785" style="s2">Tonight na special, mama. Tonight nobody</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.545" end="01:20:26.805" style="s2">cry. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.785" end="01:20:26.805" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.045" end="01:20:32.045" style="s2">Tolani,</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.244" end="01:20:34.545" style="s2">your father used to eat on a mat like</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.045" end="01:20:37.844" style="s2">this behind his shop</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.545" end="01:20:39.644" style="s2">with his tools beside his plate.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.844" end="01:20:40.545" style="s2">He would be very proud to see you down</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.644" end="01:20:42.344" style="s2">here</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.545" end="01:20:44.244" style="s2">by choice.</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.344" end="01:20:46.401" style="s2">Then he would forgive me for the marble</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.244" end="01:20:47.244" style="s2">of the first night.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.401" end="01:20:51.344" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.244" end="01:20:51.344" style="s2">He would ask you to pass the rice first.</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.945" end="01:21:04.644" style="s2">Is it real?</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.844" end="01:21:04.644" style="s2">Real gold is not afraid of the cloth.</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.736" end="01:21:25.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
